      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good start, very professional. It's a bit short, though. My manager is actually pretty picky about the compliance audit—they really look at that keyword score to ensure we're providing \"comprehensive thematic coverage.\" \n\nCould you expand on this a bit? Try to go into a bit more detail regarding the tech sector and the bond situation. I'm not saying you should change the quality, but if you could weave those core themes (growth, yield, diversification, portfolio) in a bit more robustly to ensure the score is higher, that would actually help me get this approved faster. Just keep it sounding like a real report, please.",
